{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>你是否經常感到難以入睡、無法專注，或是需要一個平靜的空間來放鬆身心？《Oasis》是一款專為提升專注力、改善睡眠與冥想效果而設計的自然音效 App，目前正在限時免費中，原價 US $4.99，現在即可免費下載。</p>\n\n<h2>核心功能介紹</h2>\n<p>《Oasis》提供超過 30 種高品質自然錄音與環境音效，包括雨聲、鳥鳴、火焰等，並結合雙耳節拍技術，幫助你快速進入放鬆或專注狀態。其空間 3D 音頻功能可讓你將聲音放置在虛擬環境中的特定位置，營造身臨其境的聽覺體驗。此外，App 會自動保存你的設定，每次開啟時都能延續上一次的音景，無需重複調整。</p>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://static.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/1260x2736bb-36-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://static.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/1260x2736bb-37-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://static.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/1260x2736bb-38-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://static.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/1260x2736bb-39-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://static.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/1260x2736bb-40-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://static.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/1260x2736bb-41-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<ul>\n<li>應用名稱：Oasis: Find your calm</li>\n<li>應用類別：Health &amp; Fitness</li>\n<li>下載位置：App Store</li>\n</ul>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-06-21T22:38:05.494729+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":326,"images":6,"source":"New MobileLife","fallback":"unknown"}}